 <limengzhe@limengzhedeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:29:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: expose native project rooms in the conversation
 workspace

Let users select native session members, broadcast with explicit partial outcomes and inspect original conversation history. Preserve uncertain-send warnings across refresh and reuse native session creation. Verified with mocked interaction tests, desktop/mobile browser checks, typecheck and renderer build; no live agent calls.
